  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education/Training Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APMF will train 100 women who will form a &quot;Network of Leaders&quot; that will conduct campaigns on the prevention of violence against women and sexual harassment and will refer victims to community and public resources. The trainees will work door-to-door and through street theater, print media and radio. The benefits of the project are expected to reach 10,000 Peruvians in the district of San Juan de Lurigancho.</narrative>
  </description>
